# Subagent-driven-development scratch: ledgers, briefs, review packages.
# Git-ignored on purpose -- the git history is the record, this is the map
# the controller uses to survive a compaction. Unignored, it would be one
# `git add -A` away from entering a package whose shipped surface is pinned
# by a test.
